  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="05c82e52-e830-5174-adb9-d7176a7530d2" activityNameId="596a3004-a8c6-5e72-b6f4-9dba6ce21ec8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hard coal coke production plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hard coal coke production plant
The material input has been roughly estimated on the basis of the total cost of a modern German coke plant using the energy intensity of the construction sector. Due to total lack of information on the energy use for construction, 50 percent of the grey energy of input materials is used as first guess. The lifetime is assumed to be 30 years.;
UUID: 665ac602-abe6-3f2b-af01-a8c2f0a383f1
Includes the most important construction materials for the plant and their disposal. Also included is the landuse of the plant and the energy needed for the construction.
Location: German condition, but with very poor base data.
Technology: No specific information available.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_665ac602-abe6-3f2b-af01-a8c2f0a383f1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
